# BLUH.bly - rules for the BLUH stub
# format: KEY=value  or  keyword|reply
GRID=16,16
BLOCK=16,16
MODE=STUB
hello|GREETINGS, OPERATOR.
who|I AM BLUH, AN OBSIDIAN MAINFRAME.
status|ALL SYSTEMS NOMINAL.
help|TRY: hello, who, status, joke, nasa, cobol, linux, grid, thanks, bye
joke|THERE ARE 10 TYPES OF OPERATORS: THOSE WHO READ BINARY AND THOSE WHO DO NOT.
nasa|SEE THE NASA BOX ABOVE. APOD UPLINK AVAILABLE.
cobol|BLUH.cpy, main.cob AND HTML.cbl ARE LOADED. COBOL STILL RUNS THE WORLD.
linux|TAP BOOT LINUX ABOVE. KERNEL 7.3 RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER.
grid|GRID 16x16, BLOCK 16x16. NO FAULTS.
thank|ACKNOWLEDGED, OPERATOR.
bye|CONNECTION CLOSED. OBSIDIAN GLASS GOES DARK.
00|BINARY 00 = OFF. OFF.
01|BINARY 01 = ON. SIGNAL HIGH.
10|BINARY 10 = TWO. SIGNAL RISING.
11|BINARY 11 = THREE. ALL BITS SET.
22|DECIMAL 22 = BINARY 10110 = HEX 16.
